{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-properties","title":"海洋的物理性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/foundations/physical-properties","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"海洋的物理性质\">海洋的物理性质</h1><p>把一杯海水放进无边的容器，它会表现得和淡水截然不同：它更难升温也更难降温，它会在冷下来时一直变重而不像淡水那样在 4 °C 反转，它能让声音传到上千公里之外，却把阳光挡在最上面那薄薄一层。海洋之所以能调节整个地球的气候、托起庞大的生态系统，根子都在这几条物理性质上。本篇只讲&quot;水这种物质在海洋尺度下的物理行为&quot;——温度、密度、压强、热容、光与声——它们是后面所有动力与生态过程的物理底座。盐分如何改变这些性质属于<a href=\"chemistry-salinity\">海水化学与盐度</a>的范畴，本篇只在密度处点到为止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-状态变量与分层\">核心概念：状态变量与分层</h2><p>描述一团海水的物理状态，三个变量就够了：温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、盐度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、压强 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。它们共同决定密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，而密度的垂直分布决定了海洋是否分层、能否上下混合——这是理解从<a href=\"../dynamics/currents-circulation\">海流与环流</a>到<a href=\"../ecology/productivity-foodweb\">海洋生产力</a>几乎所有现象的钥匙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[温度 T] --&gt; D[密度 rho]&#10;  B[盐度 S] --&gt; D&#10;  C[压强 p] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E{垂直密度梯度}&#10;  E --&gt;|强| F[强分层&lt;br/&gt;抑制垂直混合]&#10;  E --&gt;|弱| G[易混合&lt;br/&gt;营养盐上涌]&#10;  F --&gt; H[表层贫营养]&#10;  G --&gt; I[表层富营养]\">flowchart TD\n  A[温度 T] --&gt; D[密度 rho]\n  B[盐度 S] --&gt; D\n  C[压强 p] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E{垂直密度梯度}\n  E --&gt;|强| F[强分层&lt;br/&gt;抑制垂直混合]\n  E --&gt;|弱| G[易混合&lt;br/&gt;营养盐上涌]\n  F --&gt; H[表层贫营养]\n  G --&gt; I[表层富营养]</pre><p>海洋在垂直方向通常分成三层：受风浪和加热搅动、性质均匀的<strong>表层混合层</strong>（几十米到百余米）；温度随深度急剧下降的<strong>温跃层</strong>（thermocline）；以及温度低而稳定的<strong>深层水</strong>。温跃层像一道盖子，把温暖、富氧但贫营养的表层和寒冷、富营养的深层隔开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>表层海水典型值</th>\n<th>深层海水典型值</th>\n<th>与淡水的关键差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>25–28 °C（热带）</td>\n<td>1–4 °C</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比热容</td>\n<td>≈3850 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{J\\,kg^{-1}K^{-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>≈3850 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{J\\,kg^{-1}K^{-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>略低于纯水的 4186</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密度</td>\n<td>≈1022 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{kg\\,m^{-3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">kg</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>≈1028 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{kg\\,m^{-3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">kg</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>比淡水大约 2.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大密度温度</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>淡水 4 °C；海水无（一直到冰点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声速</td>\n<td>≈1530 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>≈1490 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>远快于空气的 340</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"温度与海洋的巨大热容\">温度与海洋的巨大热容</h2><p>水的比热容在所有常见液体里都名列前茅，约为 4186 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{J\\,kg^{-1}K^{-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（海水因含盐略低，约 3850）。这意味着把 1 千克海水升高 1 °C 需要的能量，是同质量空气的约四倍。海洋上层 2.5 米水的热容就抵得上整层大气，于是全球海洋成了地球最大的热库——它吸收了人类活动导致的多余能量的约 90%。2025 年全球上层 2000 米海洋热含量再创历史新高，比 2024 年增加约 23 ZJ（泽焦），这是连续第九年刷新纪录（来源：中科院大气物理研究所 IAP，2026-01 发布）。</p>\n<p>巨大的热容也让海洋成为气候的&quot;缓冲器&quot;和&quot;记忆体&quot;：沿海地区冬暖夏凉、季节滞后，靠的都是海水缓慢吞吐热量。多余热量如何反过来推动<a href=\"../human/climate-ocean\">气候变化与海洋</a>的连锁反应，是那一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"密度与海水的-异常-行为\">密度与海水的&quot;异常&quot;行为</h2><p>海水密度对温度、盐度、压强都敏感。一个反直觉的事实：纯水在 4 °C 密度最大，冷却到结冰前会先变轻而上浮（湖泊从表面开始结冰正源于此），但<strong>海水当盐度超过约 24.7 时，最大密度温度低于冰点</strong>——也就是说海水会一路冷却、一路变重、一直下沉到冰点，不存在&quot;先变轻&quot;的反转。</p>\n<p>这条性质是深层水形成的物理前提。在极地，表层海水被冷却又因结冰排盐而变咸，密度持续增大直至下沉到海底，驱动了全球尺度的热盐环流。其完整动力学在<a href=\"../dynamics/currents-circulation\">海流与环流</a>展开。海洋学常用<strong>位势密度</strong>（把水团换算到同一参考压强下的密度）来比较不同深度的水团，因为压强本身也会压缩海水、抬高其原位密度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压强-声与光的传播\">压强、声与光的传播</h2><p>海水几乎不可压缩，但深海压强惊人：每下潜 10 米约增加 1 个大气压，万米深的马里亚纳海沟底部压强超过 1100 个大气压。压强、温度、盐度共同决定<strong>声速</strong>，其经验关系近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1449.2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0.055</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1.34</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>35</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.016</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\approx 1449.2 + 4.6\\,T - 0.055\\,T^2 + 1.34\\,(S-35) + 0.016\\,z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1449.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.055</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.34</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.016</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为深度（米）。声速随深度先减后增，在约 1000 米处出现极小值，形成<strong>SOFAR 声道</strong>——声波被折射困在这一层里，可传播数千公里而几乎不衰减，鲸类的低频呼叫与早期军用水听器都利用了它。</p>\n<p>光的命运则相反。海水强烈吸收和散射光，红光在十几米内就被吸收殆尽，蓝绿光能穿透到约 200 米。据此把海洋分为三层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[真光层 0-200m&lt;br/&gt;光照充足可光合作用] --&gt; B[弱光层 200-1000m&lt;br/&gt;微光仅够视觉]&#10;  B --&gt; C[无光层 1000m 以下&lt;br/&gt;永久黑暗靠化能与碎屑]\">graph TD\n  A[真光层 0-200m&lt;br/&gt;光照充足可光合作用] --&gt; B[弱光层 200-1000m&lt;br/&gt;微光仅够视觉]\n  B --&gt; C[无光层 1000m 以下&lt;br/&gt;永久黑暗靠化能与碎屑]</pre><p>真光层（透光带）的厚度直接限定了浮游植物能在哪里生长，因此是连接物理与生态的关键边界，<a href=\"../ecology/marine-ecosystems\">海洋生态系统</a>将以此为基础划分生境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"海冰与相变\">海冰与相变</h2><p>当海水降到约 −1.8 °C（盐度 35 时的冰点，比纯水低）便开始结冰。海冰形成时盐分被排挤出冰晶，留下的高盐冷水即&quot;卤水&quot;，密度极大而下沉，是南极底层水的重要来源。海冰本身的高反照率（reflectance）把大量阳光反射回太空，是地球气候系统的强放大器：冰一旦融化，露出深色海水吸热增多，进一步加速融化，这就是<strong>冰-反照率正反馈</strong>。北极海冰范围的持续萎缩正是这一反馈的现实体现，其气候后果见<a href=\"../human/climate-ocean\">气候变化与海洋</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>温度、盐度、压强三个状态变量决定海水密度，密度的垂直梯度决定分层与混合，是理解海洋一切动力与生态过程的物理基础。</li>\n<li>水的超高比热容让海洋成为地球最大热库，吸收了人类活动多余能量的约 90%，2025 年海洋热含量再创新高。</li>\n<li>海水（盐度 &gt;24.7）冷却时一路变重直到冰点，没有淡水那样的密度反转，这是极地深层水下沉的前提。</li>\n<li>声速在约 1000 米形成 SOFAR 声道使声音远传；光只能穿透约 200 米，划出真光层这一生态关键边界。</li>\n<li>海冰结冰排盐产生高密度卤水驱动底层水，其高反照率构成冰-反照率正反馈，放大气候变化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"海洋的物理性质","id":"海洋的物理性质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：状态变量与分层","id":"核心概念-状态变量与分层"},{"level":2,"text":"温度与海洋的巨大热容","id":"温度与海洋的巨大热容"},{"level":2,"text":"密度与海水的\"异常\"行为","id":"密度与海水的-异常-行为"},{"level":2,"text":"压强、声与光的传播","id":"压强-声与光的传播"},{"level":2,"text":"海冰与相变","id":"海冰与相变"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"海水化学与盐度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/foundations/chemistry-salinity"}}